      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} \n\nHi, I blocked someone, and now a friend of mine can see him, but I can't. This person I blocked informed my friend that he could see me and knew what I was saying or where I was standing. When we went to another world, my friend was informed by the person I blocked that he couldn't see me anymore. Then, we started hopping around different worlds. Sometimes he can see me, and sometimes he can't. I hope that explains things a bit more clearly.",
