  "details": "I wanted to bring to your attention a potential bug that my friend discovered. When I block someone, I expect that they will not be able to see me, and I will not be able to see them. However, my friend informed me that even though I have blocked someone, they are still able to see me. This seems to depend on the movement of the world, as sometimes they can see me and sometimes they cannot. I would greatly appreciate it if you could look into this issue and ensure that when I block someone, they are unable to see me. Thank you for your attention to this matter.",
